      Direction","body":"Multiply 180 degrees by 0 or 1 depending on the direction,
      and set that as the Y Euler angle of the Spinner object.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"18f8c05c-984e-4e44-adcc-5075746da712","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-1708.0,"yMin":2360.0,"xMax":-1453.0,"yMax":2442.0},"title":"Animation
      Direction","body":"Only set the animation direction variable if the actual
      direction is not 0 (i.e. the enemy isn''t standing still).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"13abcefc-4f64-4172-8b2f-252d52ceb358","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-912.0,"yMin":2376.0,"xMax":-740.0,"yMax":2444.0},"title":"Animation
      Direction","body":"Only apply the flip if the enemy is not attacking.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"fafef18f-61e3-4c9c-8962-a2450f41dfb7","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-1155.0,"yMin":1063.0,"xMax":-1002.0,"yMax":1152.0},"title":"AI
      Enemy","body":"Store the percentage of the enemy''s health remaining (as a
      decimal 0-1).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"f6c4eb87-ce7f-42dd-be0a-58a782e0a62a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-1656.0,"yMin":1351.0,"xMax":-1473.0,"yMax":1428.0},"title":"AI
      Enemy","body":"Use the enemy''s velocity in units/timestep to scale the movement
      animation.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"93fb93c5-65aa-4858-ab5a-8df482fc723b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-1882.0,"yMin":1627.0,"xMax":-1743.0,"yMax":1727.0},"title":"AI
      Enemy","body":"Tell the animator whether the enemy is moving or not (0 if not
