      Enemy","body":"Permanently stop the enemy from using the Z-axis (which would
      allow it to walk around the player) by constantly moving it to 0 on the Z-axis","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"0f7c82e1-85ba-4a5a-9b40-58d5a442a76d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-3453.0,"yMin":1259.0,"xMax":-3292.0,"yMax":1337.0},"title":"AI
